{
  "_comment": [
    "Spike fixture, the small case. Same adaptations as card-processing.json:",
    "'_comment' keys are additive and not part of the ADR-0001 node shape or",
    "envelope, and the file is pretty-printed rather than canonical.",
    "Shape: 15 blocks, maximum nesting depth 4 (root = depth 1). Every block type",
    "here except myapp.signup_step / myapp.notify / myapp.provision is core.*, and",
    "every datamodel path in a 'cond' resolves in ../datamodel.json.",
    "This document is the 'does the canvas still look right when there is almost",
    "nothing on it' fixture.",
    "One block type here is PROPOSED and not shipped: core.raise, in js/proposed-",
    "core.js. It is the send half of the send -> interrupt wiring (sb-cy5) - the",
    "otherwise arm of the plan branch raises signup.abandoned, and the rail of the",
    "group the branch sits in catches it. The two are not joined by an edge; they",
    "name the same event, and the innermost enclosing group is what catches it.",
    "The verify group further up names the same event on its own rail, which is a",
    "second scope rather than a second catcher for this raise."
  ],
  "schema_version": 1,
  "id": "bdoc_signup_demo",
  "revision": 7,
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Signup wizard",
    "description": "Collect an account, verify the email, branch on the chosen plan, and provision.",
    "domain": "signup"
  },
  "root": {
    "type": "core.sequence",
    "id": "blk_su_root",
    "type_version": 1,
    "slots": {
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "myapp.signup_step",
          "id": "blk_su_account",
          "type_version": 1,
          "config": {
            "invoke_type": "myapp:signup",
            "step": "account",
            "label": "Collect email and password"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "core.group",
          "id": "blk_su_verify",
          "type_version": 1,
          "slots": {
            "body": [
              {
                "type": "myapp.signup_step",
                "id": "blk_su_send_verification",
                "type_version": 1,
                "config": {
                  "invoke_type": "myapp:signup",
                  "step": "send_verification",
                  "label": "Send the verification email"
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "core.wait",
                "id": "blk_su_verify_wait",
                "type_version": 1,
                "config": {
                  "duration": "PT24H"
                }
              }
            ],
            "interrupts": [
              {
                "type": "core.on_event",
                "id": "blk_su_verified",
                "type_version": 1,
                "config": {
                  "event": "signup.email_verified",
                  "outcome": "resume"
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "core.on_event",
                "id": "blk_su_abandoned",
                "type_version": 1,
                "config": {
                  "event": "signup.abandoned",
                  "outcome": "abandon"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "core.group",
          "id": "blk_su_onboarding",
          "type_version": 1,
          "slots": {
            "body": [
              {
                "type": "core.branch",
                "id": "blk_su_plan",
                "type_version": 1,
                "config": {
                  "arms": [
                    {
                      "slot": "arm_business",
                      "cond": "signup.plan == 'business' AND signup.seats > 1"
                    },
                    {
                      "slot": "arm_personal",
                      "cond": "signup.plan == 'personal' AND signup.email_verified"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "slots": {
                  "arm_business": [
                    {
                      "type": "myapp.signup_step",
                      "id": "blk_su_company",
                      "type_version": 1,
                      "config": {
                        "invoke_type": "myapp:signup",
                        "step": "company_details",
                        "label": "Collect the company details"
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "arm_personal": [
                    {
                      "type": "myapp.signup_step",
                      "id": "blk_su_preferences",
                      "type_version": 1,
                      "config": {
                        "invoke_type": "myapp:signup",
                        "step": "preferences",
                        "label": "Ask about preferences"
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "otherwise": [
                    {
                      "type": "myapp.notify",
                      "id": "blk_su_plan_help",
                      "type_version": 1,
                      "config": {
                        "invoke_type": "myapp:notify",
                        "template": "choose_a_plan",
                        "label": "Nudge them to pick a plan"
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "core.raise",
                      "id": "blk_su_raise_abandoned",
                      "type_version": 1,
                      "config": {
                        "event": "signup.abandoned"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "myapp.provision",
                "id": "blk_su_provision",
                "type_version": 1,
                "config": {
                  "invoke_type": "myapp:provision",
                  "label": "Create the workspace"
                }
              }
            ],
            "interrupts": [
              {
                "type": "core.on_event",
                "id": "blk_su_onboarding_abandoned",
                "type_version": 1,
                "config": {
                  "event": "signup.abandoned",
                  "outcome": "abandon"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
